{"This is a picture of a busy café.":"36043cf20dd1","The first thing I can see is a woman ordering a drink at the counter.":"9b9f410b25e4","On the right side of the picture, two people are sitting at a table.":"8d30e41f92f3","In the background, I can see some tall buildings.":"54c252f33f39","It seems like a peaceful afternoon.":"3d5c2faf7395","I usually do it about once a week, because it's convenient and saves me a lot of time.":"a1040981ba57","The main reason is that it helps me relieve stress.":"8e73e7cac5b4","To be honest, I don't do that very often.":"e0f2cb9c044f","For example, last weekend, I went there with my friends and had a great time.":"2d40427ed557","I'm sorry, but there seems to be a mistake. That session has been canceled.":"5e452ea328ea","There are two sessions you might be interested in.":"3c512e555c0d","First, from 1 to 2:30 p.m., there will be a workshop led by the IT team.":"036a9901fc9e","Don't worry. You don't need to buy them separately.":"fc5d920a09b2","I agree with the statement for two reasons.":"d5d73f327078","First of all, it gives people more opportunities to develop their skills.":"f5fcabea348d","On top of that, it helps people save both time and money.":"5cda130b2c19","For these reasons, I believe it is the better choice.":"7278c51582f8","Please make sure your mobile phones are switched to silent mode.":"485e70aebb6a","Thank you for calling. Our office is currently closed.":"64db45cf583a","If you need to schedule, change, or cancel an appointment, please press one.":"5a35df5d6a94","Later in the show, our guest will share some useful tips.":"101037b19cb0","For more information, please visit our website.":"2444e832227e","This picture was taken in a crowded street.":"6747e2a454af","In the middle of the picture, a man is holding a cup of coffee.":"88352169536d","Next to him, a woman with short hair is looking at her phone.":"0710bc13ce2d","In the foreground, there are some bicycles parked along the road.":"653142557a1b","He is wearing a white shirt and black pants.":"0d76f7e81678","They seem to be enjoying their time together.":"7a433210c2a0","Behind them, I can see a row of shops.":"a755205fb6ea","Some people are waiting in line to buy tickets.":"b324d9e41f0d","I usually go there with my family on weekends.":"faf5dc17b9fa","The last time I did it was about two weeks ago.":"504252586401","It's close to my house, so I can get there in ten minutes.":"9ed634090b64","These days, many people prefer to do it online.":"41e04713a8c0","It's much cheaper, and I can compare prices easily.":"20556914b4de","I would definitely recommend it to my friends.":"4f171f988076","When I have free time, I like to watch videos on my phone.":"b5f06a7ea91f","It helps me stay healthy and feel refreshed.":"9e8948433e8c","I think the most important thing is the location.":"dca035db61af","That's why I always check reviews before I decide.":"49a767ed0278","Let me check the schedule for you.":"8cbc1171cd61","The event will be held on Friday, May 3rd, in the main hall.":"a7353dd58bd2","It starts at 9 a.m. and ends at 5 p.m.":"ef86b64b17f9","Actually, that session has been moved to the afternoon.":"f9c3c3d47f45","You need to register by March 25th.":"10e145fff7e9","After that, you will have a lunch break from noon to 1 p.m.":"21e219bb19cb","Lastly, the day will end with a closing speech by the CEO.":"98f5a5983053","The fee is 50 dollars, and it includes lunch.":"fe5c611fddea","In my opinion, it is better to work in a team.":"b0c29a1cc9b2","I disagree with the statement for the following reasons.":"40d5f8796810","This is because people can share ideas and learn from each other.":"0b9183049a4f","As a result, they can finish their work more efficiently.":"54e29c06a90b","For example, when I was in college, I worked on a group project.":"840e90f4c829","Thanks to my teammates, we got a good grade.":"715184c0fde0","On the other hand, it can be stressful at times.":"20e3486d05c3","It can save a lot of time and reduce costs.":"05b709161b32","That's why I strongly believe that this is the right choice.":"1bd471ddc4ab","Nowadays, technology plays an important role in our daily lives.":"17cfc5d7f407","That's a good question. Let me think about it for a second.":"3db3d88a97b1","To be more specific, I mean that it's very convenient.":"0a97c3aa1126","Overall, I'm very satisfied with it.":"632b6fac6ef7","This picture was taken in an office.":"1d7935a35ac7","The first thing I can see is a man who is talking on the phone.":"31e806972c9c","He has short dark hair and he is wearing a gray suit.":"21cb0292e429","To his right, a woman is typing something on her laptop.":"3d36ce139bb8","On the table, there are some documents and a cup of coffee.":"3bebfaeb7246","In the background, I can see a large window and some plants.":"0d7f7d1b58c1","Overall, it seems like a busy morning at work.":"7a4ebe0fddac","Both of them are looking at the same direction.":"22bc36eaa64c","A few people are walking across the street.":"53fcf56b399e","Some items are displayed on the shelves.":"96ee282616d9","It looks like they are having a meeting.":"2c94e7c02f2e","The weather looks sunny and warm.":"beb2a4a69512","I go to the gym about twice a week, and I usually go with my coworkers.":"36f02021a089","The last time I went shopping was last Saturday, and I bought a jacket.":"5fc5be8a3b7c","I prefer A to B, because it is much more convenient.":"25b40de4e792","I think the price is the most important factor when choosing a hotel.":"74324597efb7","If I had the chance, I would like to try it again.":"620bcc040325","It depends on the situation, but I usually choose the cheaper one.":"4ee8bb6fb615","Honestly, I'm not really interested in that.":"cece236fc275","There are several reasons, but the biggest one is time.":"398206adf798","It's a great way to spend time with my family.":"b6cfa48dfce0","I can easily find what I want, and it saves me a lot of money.":"e26c234a8a56","Since I'm very busy on weekdays, I usually do it on weekends.":"5925c6292caf","It used to be difficult, but now it's much easier thanks to technology.":"098d4430a450","I would say about thirty minutes, more or less.":"f5a9b0eb79dd","According to the schedule, the meeting will be held on Monday at 10 a.m. in Room 302.":"5bad9f253241","I'm afraid you have the wrong information. The workshop is actually scheduled for Thursday.":"1b65ed01cc31","There are two sessions related to marketing.":"9fe94901c9a3","The first one is Social Media Strategy, which will be led by Ms. Park at 11 a.m..":"b8966723ec59","The second one is Brand Design, and it starts at 3 p.m..":"d5b86aeb487b","Don't worry, it has been rescheduled to next Tuesday.":"4d6131f08204","The registration fee is 30 dollars per person.":"7ba9dcfcb56f","Lunch will be provided, so you don't need to bring anything.":"a86ec043937d","You will be staying at the Grand Hotel for three nights.":"5afc8ff840cf","Your flight departs at 8:30 a.m. and arrives at 10:50 a.m.":"06b9900631e9","Unfortunately, that session is no longer available.":"47a23a49333c","I agree that it is better to work for a large company, for two main reasons.":"fa567ff094cc","First of all, large companies offer better benefits.":"d8d27b27f0c3","This means that employees can feel more secure about their future.":"56e9ae8f1f33","In addition, there are more opportunities to learn new skills.":"7a109149baf9","Let me give you an example. When I was in college, I did an internship at a big company.":"af3e439a6d26","Because of this experience, I learned a lot about teamwork.":"25862bcf5819","Therefore, I believe that working for a large company is the better choice.":"6c05cc25dc5d","It helps people become more independent and responsible.":"9803c74ec4ff","People can communicate more effectively with each other.":"ac351966bd4e","It allows people to focus on what really matters.":"7ed5cc9fc088","It is a good chance to gain practical experience.":"51c37be049e2","In the long run, it can lead to better results.":"3bf789ed0d38","Of course, there are some disadvantages, but the advantages are much bigger.":"6be587c0ed32","Not only does it save time, but it also reduces stress.":"90847d9db9a6","Young people these days are very familiar with technology.":"8fbe19df3b08","Let me put it this way.":"773251651938","What I mean is that it's really helpful.":"6e7df2fdc49a","I've never thought about it before, but I think it's a good idea.":"a7e0708ed4e3","As far as I know, it's very popular in Korea.":"729a96390f95","That's pretty much it.":"6b8555d613b9","This is a picture of a busy café. The first thing I can see is a woman ordering a drink at the counter. She is wearing a yellow sweater. Behind the counter, a man in an apron is preparing coffee. On the right side of the picture, two people are sitting at a round table and talking with each other. It seems like a relaxing afternoon.":"fd711f5b7dc6","This picture was taken in an office. In the middle of the picture, three people are having a meeting around a table. A man on the left is pointing at a chart on the screen. The woman next to him is taking notes on her laptop. In the background, I can see a large window and some plants. It seems like they are discussing an important project.":"adfcbe42fc5f","This is a picture of an outdoor market. The first thing I can see is a vendor standing behind a fruit stand. He is wearing a cap and handing a bag to a customer. There are many boxes of apples and oranges on the table. On the left side, a woman with a shopping basket is looking at some vegetables. It looks like a sunny weekend morning.":"5f57c5ab5e3a","This picture was taken in a park. In the foreground, a man is walking his dog along a path. On the right side of the picture, a woman is sitting on a bench and reading a book. Behind her, there are tall trees with green leaves. In the background, I can see some buildings. It seems like a peaceful day.":"c0c82f415e22","How often do you go to the movies, and who do you usually go with?":"2923ef79953c","I go to the movies about once a month, and I usually go with my friends, because we like to talk about the movie over dinner afterward.":"4b953cceabe3","What kind of movies do you usually watch, and why?":"7d0c65eccf13","I usually watch action movies. The main reason is that they help me relieve stress after a long week at work.":"c2c32e2bfd88","Do you prefer to watch movies at a theater or at home? Why?":"4638daeaa794","I prefer to watch movies at a theater. First of all, the screen and the sound are much better, so I can really focus on the story. Also, it's a good way to spend time with my friends outside the house. For example, last weekend, I watched a new action movie with my friends, and it was much more exciting than watching it on my phone. That's why I prefer theaters.":"1c84c054933a","Where is the nearest grocery store, and how do you usually get there?":"0e1ae503ae5c","The nearest grocery store is about five minutes away from my apartment, so I usually walk there. It's really convenient.":"c3c382d39d6e","When do you usually go grocery shopping, and why?":"72f88a94213d","I usually go grocery shopping on Sunday mornings, because the store isn't crowded and the vegetables are fresh.":"0e7fb5549c0a","What do you think is the most important thing when choosing a grocery store? Why?":"93527a0fdff0","I think the most important thing is the price. These days, food prices are going up, so I want to save money on groceries. Also, cheaper stores often have discounts and special events. For example, the store near my house has a big sale every weekend, so I can buy fruit and meat at lower prices. That's why I think price is the most important.":"2c3ec1d12670","How often do you exercise, and where do you usually do it?":"1cfc6571b0d8","I exercise about three times a week, and I usually go to a gym near my office after work.":"d62407130f31","What kind of exercise do you enjoy the most? Why?":"448fd2713b06","I enjoy running the most, because it's simple and I can do it anywhere without any equipment.":"bbc8d46105a4","Do you prefer to exercise alone or with other people? Why?":"356521a28a1d","I prefer to exercise with other people. First, it's more fun, so I don't get bored easily. Also, my friends motivate me to keep going even when I'm tired. For example, last month I joined a running club, and now I run much longer than before. That's why I like exercising with others.":"a3a69b545092","How many hours a day do you use your smartphone, and what do you mainly use it for?":"648d25977e58","I use my smartphone about four hours a day, and I mainly use it for watching videos and sending messages.":"e699f5a279db","When was the last time you bought a new phone, and why did you buy it?":"2d13e8b2141c","The last time I bought a new phone was last year, because my old phone's battery didn't last long.":"01e479b769c9","What do you think is the most important feature when buying a smartphone? Why?":"894c2ecf8120","I think the most important feature is the battery life. These days, I use my phone for almost everything, like banking, navigation, and work. If the battery dies, I can't do anything. For example, last month my phone died during a business trip, and I couldn't find my hotel. That's why battery life matters most to me.":"4e90985c8f79","What time does the orientation begin, and where will it be held?":"f7f5c765ab8b","The orientation begins at 9 a.m. on Monday, March 9th, and it will be held in Room 302.":"6f1d16ebf95c","I heard that we will learn about our clients in the morning. Is that right?":"a5a71681c447","I'm sorry, but there seems to be a mistake. The session Introduction to Our Clients, which was scheduled from 10:30 to 11:30, has been canceled.":"b004cd11e3db","Could you give me all the details about the sessions after lunch?":"a6474a0417b4","Sure. There are two sessions after lunch. First, from 1 to 2:30 p.m., there will be a Computer System Setup session led by the IT team. After that, from 2:30 to 3:30, you will have a team meeting where you can meet your managers.":"3a26b6934f66","When do the spring classes start, and how can I register?":"eacb6b782dde","The spring classes start on April 1st. You can register online or at the front desk by March 25th.":"d0a6af87ab99","I'd like to take the painting class, but do I need to buy the materials separately?":"bb076ca0dad7","Don't worry. You don't need to buy them separately. The Watercolor Painting class costs 80 dollars, and the materials are included.":"193f00de5f5d","I'm only free on weekday evenings. Could you tell me about all the classes I can take?":"305f2eeeefed","Sure. There are three classes you can take on weekday evenings. First, Yoga for Beginners is on Mondays and Wednesdays from 7 to 8 p.m. Second, Watercolor Painting is on Tuesdays from 6:30 to 8:30. Lastly, Photography Basics is on Thursdays from 7 to 9 p.m.":"ca09e09e2092","What time does my flight leave on Monday, and when does it arrive?":"e3c2d5857d9d","Your flight, KE 703, leaves Seoul at 8:30 a.m. on Monday, and it arrives in Tokyo at 10:50 a.m.":"39d9f5d6ab84","I remember I'm visiting the factory on Tuesday morning. Is that correct?":"a27b035fb51d","I'm sorry, but the factory tour on Tuesday at 10 a.m. has been canceled, so you don't need to go there.":"77409b03dcac","Could you tell me all the details of my schedule on Tuesday afternoon?":"503865b4a3cb","Sure. There are two things scheduled for Tuesday afternoon. First, at 1 p.m., you will have lunch with a client at Sakura Restaurant. After that, at 4 p.m., you will give a product presentation.":"5aabf7e9c367","I agree that it is better to work for a large company, for two reasons. First of all, large companies usually offer higher salaries and better benefits. This means employees can feel more financially stable and focus on their work. On top of that, large companies provide many training programs, so workers can develop their skills. For example, my friend works for a big electronics company, and last year she took a free online course on data analysis. Thanks to this, she was able to lead a new project. For these reasons, I think working for a large company is better.":"833d0149494d","I think good communication skills are more important for a new employee. First of all, new employees need to ask a lot of questions and learn from their coworkers. If they communicate well, they can adapt to the company much faster. Also, most work is done in teams these days, so it is important to share ideas clearly. For example, when I started my first part-time job, I didn't know how to use the system, but I asked my manager politely and learned it in a day. For these reasons, I believe communication skills matter more.":"cfb55219f80e","In my opinion, high school students should be required to do volunteer work. First, volunteering helps students learn responsibility. They have to arrive on time and finish their tasks, which is good practice for the future. Second, it gives them a chance to meet people from different backgrounds. For example, when I was in high school, I volunteered at a local library and taught children how to read. It made me more patient and confident. That's why I think volunteer work should be required.":"71f7a577a293","I prefer to work from home for two reasons. First of all, I can save a lot of time because I don't have to commute. I used to spend almost two hours on the subway every day. On top of that, I can focus better in a quiet environment. For example, last month I worked from home for a week, and I finished my report two days earlier than planned. For these reasons, I think working from home is better for me.":"0f748a1256c8","I agree that online classes are as effective as classroom classes. First, students can watch the lectures again and again, so they can review difficult parts. Second, they can study anytime and anywhere, which saves time. For example, I prepared for this test with online lectures. Whenever I didn't understand something, I just replayed the video. Thanks to this, I was able to study efficiently. That's why I agree with the statement.":"56600f92a259","I think honesty is the most important quality of a good leader. If a leader is honest, team members can trust them. As a result, the team can work together more smoothly. Also, an honest leader admits mistakes, which creates a healthy work environment. For example, my former manager always explained the reasons behind her decisions, and everyone respected her. For these reasons, I believe honesty matters most.":"c00a5a04b7b3"}